    "detailed_description": "Master the art of deflection, execute deadly moves, and conquer challenging bosses in a Sekiro-inspired soulslike game. Choose contracts, defeat mobs for rewards, and evolve your character with an immersive skill tree<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/afdf9a6012f93cbe7a99cba433758893.poster.avif?t=1720884059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/afdf9a6012f93cbe7a99cba433758893.webm?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/afdf9a6012f93cbe7a99cba433758893.mp4?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong></i><br>Prepare for breathtaking showdowns against a series of awe-inspiring bosses. Each arena presents a unique challenge, and only the most skilled players will emerge victorious. Can you conquer them all and unlock new arenas in your quest to become the ultimate warrior?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/fb72e08d9b4a99bc6f2ca29797404671.poster.avif?t=1720884059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/fb72e08d9b4a99bc6f2ca29797404671.webm?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/fb72e08d9b4a99bc6f2ca29797404671.mp4?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Parry and Execution Based Combat</strong></i><br>In Colessium Enigma, timing is everything. Master the art of parrying, execute your enemies with precision, and revel in the satisfaction of a perfectly timed counter attack. Our combat system captures the essence of Sekiro, delivering a heart-pounding experience that demands skill and finesse.<br><br><i><strong>Special Attacks</strong></i><br>Unleash the fury of your inner warrior with a variety of special attacks. Whether you're dishing out ice attacks to damage enemies in front of you or freezing every foe in your vicinity, these unique abilities add an exciting layer of strategy to your battles. Harness the power of these moves to gain the upper hand in your quest to conquer the arenas.<br><br><i><strong>Different Character Builds</strong></i><br>Customize your playstyle with a diverse range of character builds. Tailor your character to suit your preferred combat approach, whether you favor agile finesse, brute force, or something in between. Experiment with different loadouts and create the ultimate warrior to take on the toughest challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/273816a3b4439e9c17488e3a59f9f173.poster.avif?t=1720884059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/273816a3b4439e9c17488e3a59f9f173.webm?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/273816a3b4439e9c17488e3a59f9f173.mp4?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Contracts</strong></i><br>If you seek to enhance your character's stats before facing the bosses, take on contracts that challenge you to defeat waves of formidable mobs in the arenas. Be rewarded with random items and valuable experience as you hone your skills and prepare for your ultimate showdown.",
    "about_the_game": "Master the art of deflection, execute deadly moves, and conquer challenging bosses in a Sekiro-inspired soulslike game. Choose contracts, defeat mobs for rewards, and evolve your character with an immersive skill tree<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/afdf9a6012f93cbe7a99cba433758893.poster.avif?t=1720884059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/afdf9a6012f93cbe7a99cba433758893.webm?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/afdf9a6012f93cbe7a99cba433758893.mp4?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong></i><br>Prepare for breathtaking showdowns against a series of awe-inspiring bosses. Each arena presents a unique challenge, and only the most skilled players will emerge victorious. Can you conquer them all and unlock new arenas in your quest to become the ultimate warrior?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/fb72e08d9b4a99bc6f2ca29797404671.poster.avif?t=1720884059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/fb72e08d9b4a99bc6f2ca29797404671.webm?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/fb72e08d9b4a99bc6f2ca29797404671.mp4?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Parry and Execution Based Combat</strong></i><br>In Colessium Enigma, timing is everything. Master the art of parrying, execute your enemies with precision, and revel in the satisfaction of a perfectly timed counter attack. Our combat system captures the essence of Sekiro, delivering a heart-pounding experience that demands skill and finesse.<br><br><i><strong>Special Attacks</strong></i><br>Unleash the fury of your inner warrior with a variety of special attacks. Whether you're dishing out ice attacks to damage enemies in front of you or freezing every foe in your vicinity, these unique abilities add an exciting layer of strategy to your battles. Harness the power of these moves to gain the upper hand in your quest to conquer the arenas.<br><br><i><strong>Different Character Builds</strong></i><br>Customize your playstyle with a diverse range of character builds. Tailor your character to suit your preferred combat approach, whether you favor agile finesse, brute force, or something in between. Experiment with different loadouts and create the ultimate warrior to take on the toughest challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/273816a3b4439e9c17488e3a59f9f173.poster.avif?t=1720884059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/273816a3b4439e9c17488e3a59f9f173.webm?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619340/extras/273816a3b4439e9c17488e3a59f9f173.mp4?t=1720884059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i><strong>Contracts</strong></i><br>If you seek to enhance your character's stats before facing the bosses, take on contracts that challenge you to defeat waves of formidable mobs in the arenas. Be rewarded with random items and valuable experience as you hone your skills and prepare for your ultimate showdown.",
